Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.11,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:24.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 这一切都怨你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:31.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 没有做坏事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,别废话了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:48.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:04.79,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:09.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:11.12,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还有真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:19.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:35.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 这里是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:40.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,王国都城？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:43.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.91,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:56.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然跑出来很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小...小空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？好神奇的交通工具 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有受伤？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟 你一个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是很大的城市 一不小心就会走散的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:22.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我们会注意的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:25.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不晓得你是哪位贵人 给您添麻烦...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是打哪个乡村来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的天泪公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}要解释大公主的名字，先要再提一下小公主名字\N官方说法是写作法语"elle(e)-她"，但是意义是希伯来语"el-神"\N同时有法语"ailes-翅膀"之意，按HK官方说法，还有希腊语"光明"\N之外还有拥抱里也提过的英语"yell-阿花"、"air-天空"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:37.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天泪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,和小空的名字一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\}{\fs50}考虑到大公主和小公主名字部分相同的说法\N这里选择了air+rain的组合\N除此外之外还有+line、+rein等\N各两两组合，其中也不乏有诸多贴近作品背景的含义\N而大公主的原名则是"Elaine-伊莱恩"的变体\N指美丽的女性，也有光辉之人的含义
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呦 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:42.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.72,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也叫天空哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个好名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:48.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 你帮我分析一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:51.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 应该小晴给我分析一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看... 这里应该不是我们熟悉的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:55.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:00.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了从没见过的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:00.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你们似乎遇上了困难
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如若不嫌弃 不妨到城堡里一聊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:19.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请问 现在是蓝天大地历几几年？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？当然是556年啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:27.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是300年前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:38.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典是在向我们展示亲历的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:41.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:54.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是发生在暴风之夜的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:58.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗世界的魔物 向蓝天大地发起进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,战争开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:02.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的公主向天祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:08.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请天降英雄 夺回我们的蓝天与人民的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:13.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是公主的祈祷传达给了上苍 勇敢的战士·Precure挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:16.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure拯救了蓝天大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可思议的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:26.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真正发生过的...不对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是即将在这里上演的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:33.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请相信我们！我们是从未来的蓝天大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的确是有未曾见过的魔物袭击城市
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 大家齐心协力打倒了它
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 人类变身为英雄这种事...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我证明给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:54.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:01.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为啥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:07.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:08.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:14.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咜！呀！嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喵！嗒嗒嗒嗒嗒嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.86,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,诶呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请用这间陋室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.42,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,腻害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你 天泪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:32.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在叫小空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是那位公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:38.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 小空才是公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,公主是小空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:45.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶... 两位都是公主 两位也都叫天空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:49.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,连我都要分不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你们晚安 小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.72,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好 晚安！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:15:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来的这个国家是怎么样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.18,0:15:02.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:10.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是个好地方 充满了活力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:13.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,国民们既善良又勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:14.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还有还有！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都和睦相处
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:17.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:21.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,人族 鸟族和龙族 大家携手共进 安居乐业
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们想要保护这美妙的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为此我们在战斗着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:33.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure的力量 是保护重要的事物的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在相信你们所生活的未来蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信你们是Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再跟我慢慢聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:47.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（雷鸣声）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量才是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱肉强食是宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:09.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,前进！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（钟声）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:23.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:30.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾名皇帝·暗塌谷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:33.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝国的支配者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:38.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,前来蹂躏这个只有弱者在蠕动的毫无价值世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:43.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:47.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,无法变身成Precure 就没法战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快去避难！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（惨叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空拜托你们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:56.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:58.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:06.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能坐视不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.41,0:17:08.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:15.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我来会会你！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:20.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:23.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只会欺负弱者的卑鄙小人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有Precure的力量 就无法净化乱暴兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 应该有我力所能及的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:33.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:49.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦... 啦啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:53.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.93,0:17:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:02.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,别停下脚步 英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（掌声）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:13.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱者也挺努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是弱是强 我们切磋一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:20.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 来吧 暗塌谷能量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:33.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量是最强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:38.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要做梦 能够与之相抗衡了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:47.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈哈... 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:51.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃往城外！城里已经不安全了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我来拖延时间！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:21.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要冲过去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了... 我们无法抵御那些怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经无路可退了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（抽泣声）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护重要事物的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:01.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:21.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的公主向天期待
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:27.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请天降英雄 夺回我们的蓝天与人民的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:32.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是公主的祈祷传达给了上苍 勇敢的战士挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,其名唤作...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:03.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中的Precure 并非是响应了公主的祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:07.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,公主就是传说中的Precure本身啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:10.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:14.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不 从今天起我就是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.20,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}高尚愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:26.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是Precure的诞生...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:32.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典 你还打算让我们见证什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:38.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:40.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:43.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,应该命令过你 不要来战场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:44.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:49.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你 一人之下 你这个上不了战场的文职教员！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,非常惭愧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:55.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们回帝国去吧 未来的女帝殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:57.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争只会催生出眼泪啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.73,0:22:10.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.73,0:22:10.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1090,970)}威爱愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:13.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:50.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,来到300年前的蓝天大地的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:53.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里遇到的 是传说中的Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:55.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,过去究竟发生过什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.65,0:23:58.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那个人 难道她是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:01.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:01.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:04.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝国的善良少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:16.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:22.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:27.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:35.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:40.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:44.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:50.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:55.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:57.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:01.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:05.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.57,0:02:08.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:08.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:16.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:21.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:26.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:31.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:42.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
